BugInfo.Advice:
确保从受信任的环境中加载数据；避免使用字符串来表示要加载的类的目录。  

**例如**：下列代码中从`actInfo.applicationInfo.sourceDir`获取`dexPath`。  
```java
...  
String dexPath = actInfo.applicationInfo.sourceDir;    
String optimizedDirectory = getApplicationInfo().dataDir;    
DexClassLoader calssLoader = new DexClassLoader(dexPath, optimizedDirectory, null, getClassLoader());  
...
```
